                <div style="background: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                  <p style="margin: 0; color: #1e40af; font-weight: 500;">
                    <strong><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:middle;margin-right:4px;"><use href="#icon-info"/></svg> System Configuration:</strong> All settings configured here are stored in the database and dynamically control the system behavior. Changes take effect immediately after saving.
