                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2937;">JSON Flow Editor (Per Role)</h3>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.85rem;">Start with JSON editor for proven flow patterns. Save role-specific arrays of question/answer entries.</p>
                <textarea id="chatbotFlowJson" rows="12" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 0.84rem; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; resize: vertical; background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0;">[]</textarea>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;">
                  <button type="button" id="chatbotLoadJsonBtn" style="padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; background: #fff; cursor: pointer;">Load Current Role JSON</button>
                  <button type="button" id="chatbotSaveJsonBtn" style="padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: none; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8, #1e40af); cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600;">Save JSON</button>
                  <div id="chatbotJsonMsg" style="display: none; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;"></div>
                </div>
